morally) detest","kjv":"(make to be) abhor(-red), (be, commit more, do) abominable(-y), [idiom] utterly","deriv":"a primitive root"},"H8582":{"lemma":"תָּעָה","translit":"tâʻâh","pron":"taw-aw'","def":"to vacillate, i.e. reel or stray (literally or figuratively); also causative of both","kjv":"(cause to) go astray, deceive, dissemble, (cause to, make to) err, pant, seduce, (make to) stagger, (cause to) wander, be out of the way","deriv":"a primitive root"},"H8583":{"lemma":"תֹּעוּ","translit":"Tôʻûw","pron":"to'-oo","def":"Tou or Toi, a Syrian king","kjv":"Toi, Tou","deriv":"or תֹּעִי; from H8582 (תָּעָה); error"},"H8584":{"lemma":"תְּעוּדָה","translit":"tᵉʻûwdâh","pron":"teh-oo-daw'","def":"attestation, i.e. a precept, usage","kjv":"testimony","deriv":"from H5749 (עוּד)"},"H8585":{"lemma":"תְּעָלָה","translit":"tᵉʻâlâh","pron":"teh-aw-law'","def":"a channel (into which water is raised for irrigation); also a bandage or plaster (as placed upon a wound)","kjv":"conduit, cured, healing, little river, trench, watercourse","deriv":"from H5927 (עָלָה)"},"H8586":{"lemma":"תַּעֲלוּל","translit":"taʻălûwl","pron":"tah-al-ool'","def":"caprice (as a fit coming on), i.e. vexation; concretely a tyrant","kjv":"babe, delusion","deriv":"from H5953 (עָלַל)"},"H8587":{"lemma":"תַּעֲלֻמָּה","translit":"taʻălummâh","pron":"tah-al-oom-maw'","def":"a secret","kjv":"thing that is hid, secret","deriv":"from H5956 (עָלַם)"},"H8588":{"lemma":"תַּעֲנוּג","translit":"taʻănûwg","pron":"tah-an-oog'","def":"luxury","kjv":"delicate, delight, pleasant","deriv":"or תַּעֲנֻג; and (feminine) תַּעֲנֻגָה; from H6026 (עָנַג)"},"H8589":{"lemma":"תַּעֲנִית","translit":"taʻănîyth","pron":"tah-an-eeth'","def":"affliction (of self), i.e. fasting","kjv":"heaviness","deriv":"from H6031 (עָנָה)"},"H8590":{"lemma":"תַּעֲנָךְ","translit":"Taʻănâk","pron":"tah-an-awk'","def":"Taanak or Tanak, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Taanach, Tanach","deriv":"or תַּעְנָךְ; of uncertain derivation"},"H8591":{"lemma":"תָּעַע","t