"kjv":"baked piece","deriv":"from H644 (אָפָה)"},"H8602":{"lemma":"תָּפֵל","translit":"tâphêl","pron":"taw-fale'","def":"plaster (as gummy) or slime; (figuratively) frivolity","kjv":"foolish things, unsavoury, untempered","deriv":"from an unused root meaning to smear"},"H8603":{"lemma":"תֹּפֶל","translit":"Tôphel","pron":"to'-fel","def":"Tophel, a place near the Desert","kjv":"Tophel","deriv":"from the same as H8602 (תָּפֵל); quagmire"},"H8604":{"lemma":"תִּפְלָה","translit":"tiphlâh","pron":"tif-law'","def":"frivolity","kjv":"folly, foolishly","deriv":"from the same as H8602 (תָּפֵל)"},"H8605":{"lemma":"תְּפִלָּה","translit":"tᵉphillâh","pron":"tef-il-law'","def":"intercession, supplication; by implication, a hymn","kjv":"prayer","deriv":"from H6419 (פָּלַל)"},"H8606":{"lemma":"תִּפְלֶצֶת","translit":"tiphletseth","pron":"tif-leh'-tseth","def":"fearfulness","kjv":"terrible","deriv":"from H6426 (פָּלַץ)"},"H8607":{"lemma":"תִּפְסַח","translit":"Tiphçach","pron":"tif-sakh'","def":"Tiphsach, a place in Mesopotamia","kjv":"Tipsah","deriv":"from H6452 (פָּסַח); ford"},"H8608":{"lemma":"תָּפַף","translit":"tâphaph","pron":"taw-faf'","def":"to drum, i.e. play (as) on the tambourine","kjv":"taber, play with timbrels","deriv":"a primitive root"},"H8609":{"lemma":"תָּפַר","translit":"tâphar","pron":"taw-far'","def":"to sew","kjv":"(women that) sew (together)","deriv":"a primitive root"},"H8610":{"lemma":"תָּפַשׂ","translit":"tâphas","pron":"taw-fas'","def":"to manipulate, i.e. seize; chiefly to capture, wield, specifically, to overlay; figuratively, to use unwarrantably","kjv":"catch, handle, (lay, take) hold (on, over), stop, [idiom] surely, surprise, take","deriv":"a primitive root"},"H8611":{"lemma":"תֹּפֶת","translit":"tôpheth","pron":"to'-feth","def":"a smiting, i.e. (figuratively) contempt","kjv":"tabret","deriv":"from the base of H8608 (תָּפַף)"},"H8612":{"lemma":"תֹּפֶת","translit":"Tôpheth","pron":"to'-feth","def":"Topheth, a place near Jerusalem","kjv":"Tophet, Topheth","deriv":"the same as H8611 (תֹּפֶת)"},"H8613":{"lemma":"תׇּפְתֶּה","translit":"Tophteh","pron":"tof-teh'","def":"Tophteh, a place of cremation","kjv":"Tophet","deriv":"probably a form of H8612 (תֹּפֶת)"},"H8614":{"lemma":"תִּפְתַּי","translit":"tiphtay","pron":"tif-tah'-ee","def":"judicial, i.e. a lawyer","kjv":"sheriff","deriv":"(Aramaic) perhaps from H8199 (שָׁפַט)"},"H8615":{"lemma":"תִּקְוָה","translit":"tiqvâh","pron":"tik-vaw'","def":"literally a cord (as an attachment); figuratively, expectancy","kjv":"expectation(-ted), hope, live, thing that I long for","deriv":"from H6960 (קָוָה); (compare H6961 (קָוֶה))"},"H8616":{"lemma":"תִּקְוָה","translit":"Tiqvâh","pron":"tik-vaw'","def":"Tikvah, the name of two Israelites","kjv":"Tikvah","deriv":"the same as H8615 (תִּקְוָה)"},"H8617":{"lemma":"תְּקוּמָה","translit":"tᵉqûwmâh","pron":"tek-oo-maw'","def":"resistfulness","kjv":"power to stand","deriv":"from H6965 (קוּם)"},"H8618":{"lemma":"תְּקוֹמֵם","translit":"tᵉqôwmêm","pron":"tek-o-mame'","def":"an opponent","kjv":"rise up against","deriv":"from H6965 (קוּם)"},"H8619":{"lemma":"תָּקוֹעַ","translit":"tâqôwaʻ","pron":"taw-ko'-ah","def":"a trumpet","kjv":"trumpet","deriv":"from H8628 (תָּקַע) (in the musical sense)"},"H8620":{"lemma":"תְּקוֹעַ","translit":"Tᵉqôwaʻ","pron":"tek-o'-ah","def":"Tekoa, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Tekoa, Tekoah","deriv":"a form of H8619 (תָּקוֹעַ)"},"H8621":{"lemma":"תְּקוֹעִי","translit":"Tᵉqôwʻîy","pron":"tek-o-ee'","def":"a Tekoite or inhabitant of Tekoah","kjv":"Tekoite","deriv":"or תְּקֹעִי; patronymically from H8620 (תְּקוֹעַ)"},"H8622":{"lemma":"תְּקוּפָה","translit":"tᵉqûwphâh","pron":"tek-oo-faw'","def":"a revolution, i.e. (of the sun) course, (of time) lapse","kjv":"circuit, come about, end","deriv":"or תְּקֻפָה; from H5362 (נָקַף)"},"H8623":{"lemma":"תַּקִּיף","translit":"taqqîyph","pron":"tak-keef'","def":"powerful","kjv":"mightier","deriv":"from H8630 (תָּקַף)"},"H8624":{"lemma":"תַּקִּיף","translit":"taqqîyph","pron":"tak-keef'","def":"powerful","kjv":"mighty, strong","deriv":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8623 (תַּקִּיף)"},"H8625":{"lemma":"תְּקַל","translit":"tᵉqal","pron":"tek-al'","def":"to balance","kjv":"Tekel, be weighed","deriv":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8254 (שָׁקַל)"},"H8626":{"lemma":"תָּקַן","translit":"tâqan","pron":"taw-kan'","def":"to equalize, i.e. straighten (intransitive or transitive); figuratively, to compose","kjv":"set in order, make straight","deriv":"a primitive root"},"H8627":{"lemma":"תְּקַן","translit":"tᵉqan","pron":"tek-an'","def":"to straighten up, i.e. confirm","kjv":"establish","deriv":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8626 (תָּקַן)"},"H8628":{"lemma":"תָּקַע","translit":"tâqaʻ","pron":"taw-kah'","def":"to clatter, i.e. slap (the hands together), clang (an instrument); by analogy, to drive (a nail or tent-pin, a dart, etc.); by implication, to become bondsman by handclasping)","kjv":"blow (a trumpet), cast, clap, fasten, pitch (tent), smite, sound, strike, [idiom] suretiship, thrust","deriv":"a primitive root"},"H8629":{"lemma":"תֵּקַע","translit":"têqaʻ","pron":"tay-kah'","def":"a blast of a trumpet","kjv":"sound","deriv":"from H8628 (תָּקַע)"},"H8630":{"lemma":"תָּקַף","translit":"tâqaph","pron":"taw-kaf'","def":"to overpower","kjv":"prevail (against)","deriv":"a primitive root"},"H8631":{"lemma":"תְּקֵף","translit":"tᵉqêph","pron":"tek-afe'","def":"to become (causatively, make) mighty or (figuratively) obstinate","kjv":"make firm, harden, be(-come) strong","deriv":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8630 (תָּקַף)"},"H8632":{"lemma":"תְּקֹף","translit":"tᵉqôph","pron":"tek-ofe'","def":"power","kjv":"might, strength","deriv":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8633 (תֹּקֶף)"},"H8633":{"lemma":"תֹּקֶף","translit":"tôqeph","pron":"to'-kef","def":"might or (figuratively) positiveness","kjv":"authority, power, strength","deriv":"from H8630 (תָּקַף)"},"H8634":{"lemma":"תַּרְאֲלָה","translit":"Tarʼălâh","pron":"tar-al-aw'","def":"Taralah, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Taralah","deriv":"probably for H8653 (תַּרְעֵלָה); a reeling"},"H8635":{"lemma":"תַּרְבּוּת","translit":"tarbûwth","pron":"tar-booth'","def":"multiplication, i.e. progeny","kjv":"increase","deriv":"from H7235 (רָבָה)"},"H8636":{"lemma":"תַּרְבִּית","translit":"tarbîyth","pron":"tar-beeth'","def":"multiplication, i.e. percentage or bonus in addition to principal","kjv":"increase, unjust gain","deriv":"from H7235 (רָבָה)"},"H8637":{"lemma":"תִּרְגַּל","translit":"tirgal","pron":"teer-gal'","def":"to cause to walk","kjv":"teach to go","deriv":"a denominative from H7270 (רָגַל)"},"H8638":{"lemma":"תִּרְגַּם","translit":"tirgam","pron":"teer-gam'","def":"to transfer, i.e. translate","kjv":"interpret","deriv":"a denominative from H7275 (רָגַם) in the sense of throwing over"},"H8639":{"lemma":"תַּרְדֵּמָה","translit":"tardêmâh","pron":"tar-day-maw'","def":"a lethargy or (by implication) trance","kjv":"deep sleep","deriv":"from H7290 (רָדַם)"},"H8640":{"lemma":"תִּרְהָקָה","translit":"Tirhâqâh","pron":"teer-haw'-kaw","def":"Tirhakah, a king of Kush","kjv":"Tirhakah","deriv":"of foreign derivation"},"H8641":{"lemma":"תְּרוּמָה","translit":"tᵉrûwmâh","pron":"ter-oo-maw'","def":"a present (as offered up), especially in sacrifice or as tribute","kjv":"gift, heave offering (shoulder), oblation, offered(-ing)","deriv":"or תְּרֻמָה; (Deuteronomy 12:11), from H7311 (רוּם)"},"H8642":{"lemma":"תְּרוּמִיָּה","translit":"tᵉrûwmîyâh","pron":"ter-oo-mee-yaw'","def":"a sacrificial offering","kjv":"oblation","deriv":"formed as H8641 (תְּרוּמָה)"},"H8643":{"lemma":"תְּרוּעָה","translit":"tᵉrûwʻâh","pron":"ter-oo-aw'","def":"clamor, i.e. acclamation of joy or a battle-cry; especially clangorof trumpets, as an alarum","kjv":"alarm, blow(-ing) (of, the) (trumpets), joy, jubile, loud noise, rejoicing, shout(-ing), (high, joyful) sound(-ing)","deriv":"from H7321 (רוּעַ)"},"H8644":{"lemma":"תְּרוּפָה","translit":"tᵉrûwphâh","pron":"ter-oo-faw'","def":"a remedy","kjv":"medicine","deriv":"from H7322 (רוּף) in the sense of its congener H7495 (רָפָא)"},"H8645":{"lemma":"תִּרְזָה","translit":"tirzâh","pron":"teer-zaw'","def":"a species of tree (apparently from its slenderness), perhaps the cypress","kjv":"cypress","deriv":"probably from H7329 (רָזָה)"},"H8646":{"lemma":"תֶּרַח","translit":"Terach","pron":"teh'-rakh","def":"Terach, the father of Abraham; also a place in the Desert","kjv":"Tarah, Terah","deriv":"of uncertain derivation"},"H8647":{"lemma":"תִּרְחֲנָה","translit":"Tirchănâh","pron":"teer-khan-aw'","def":"Tirchanah, an Israelite","kjv":"Tirhanah","deriv":"of uncertain derivation"},"H8648":{"lemma":"תְּרֵין","translit":"tᵉrêyn","pron":"ter-ane'","def":"two","kjv":"second, [phrase] twelve, two","deriv":"(Aramaic) feminine תַּרְתֵּין; corresponding to H8147 (שְׁנַיִם)"},"H8649":{"lemma":"תׇּרְמָה","translit":"tormâh","pron":"tor-maw'","def":"fraud","kjv":"deceit(-ful), privily","deriv":"and תַּרְמוּת; or תַּרְמִית; from H7411 (רָמָה)"},"H8650":{"lemma":"תֹּרֶן","translit":"tôren","pron":"to'-ren","def":"a pole (as a mast or flagstaff)","kjv":"beacon, mast","deriv":"probably for H766 (אֹרֶן)"},"H8651":{"lemma":"תְּרַע","translit":"tᵉraʻ","pron":"ter-ah'","def":"a door; by implication, a palace","kjv":"gate mouth","deriv":"(Aramaic) corresponding to H8179 (שַׁעַר)"},"H8652":{"lemma":"תָּרָע","translit":"târâʻ","pron":"taw-raw'","def":"a doorkeeper","kjv":"porter","deriv":"(Aramaic) from H8651 (תְּרַע)"},"H8653":{"lemma":"תַּרְעֵלָה","translit":"tarʻêlâh","pron":"tar-ay-law'","def":"reeling","kjv":"astonishment, trembling","deriv":"from H7477 (רָעַל)"},"H8654":{"lemma":"תִּרְעָתִי","translit":"Tirʻâthîy","pron":"teer-aw-thee'","def":"a Tirathite or inhabitant of an unknown Tirah","kjv":"Tirathite","deriv":"patrial from an unused name meaning gate"},"H8655":{"lemma":"תְּרָפִים","translit":"tᵉrâphîym","pron":"ter-aw-feme'","def":"Teraphim (singular or plural) a family idol","kjv":"idols(-atry), images, teraphim","deriv":"plural from H7495 (רָפָא); a healer"},"H8656":{"lemma":"תִּרְצָה","translit":"Tirtsâh","pron":"teer-tsaw'","def":"Tirtsah, a place in Palestine; also an Israelitess","kjv":"Tirzah","deriv":"from H7521 (רָצָה); delightsomeness"},"H8657":{"lemma":"תֶּרֶשׁ","translit":"Teresh","pron":"teh'-resh","def":"Teresh, a eunuch of Xerxes","kjv":"Teresh","deriv":"of foreign derivation"},"H8658":{"lemma":"תַּרְשִׁישׁ","translit":"tarshîysh","pron":"tar-sheesh'","def":"a gem, perhaps the topaz","kjv":"beryl","deriv":"probably of foreign derivation (compare H8659 (תַּרְשִׁישׁ))"},"H8659":{"lemma":"תַּרְשִׁישׁ","translit":"Tarshîysh","pron":"tar-sheesh'","def":"Tarshish, a place on the Mediterranean, hence, the ephithet of a merchant vessel (as if for or from that port); also the name of a Persian and of an Israelite","kjv":"Tarshish, Tharshish","deriv":"probably the same as H8658 (תַּרְשִׁישׁ) (as the region of the stone, or the reverse)"},"H8660":{"lemma":"תִּרְשָׁתָא","translit":"Tirshâthâʼ","pron":"teer-shaw-thaw'","def":"Tirshatha, the title of a Persian deputy or governor","kjv":"Tirshatha","deriv":"of foreign derivation"},"H8661":{"lemma":"תַּרְתָּן","translit":"Tartân","pron":"tar-tawn'","def":"Tartan, an Assyrian","kjv":"Tartan","deriv":"of foreign derivation"},"H8662":{"lemma":"תַּרְתָּק","translit":"Tartâq","pron":"tar-tawk'","def":"Tartak, a deity of the Avvites","kjv":"Tartak","deriv":"of foreign derivation"},"H8663":{"lemma":"תְּשֻׁאָה","translit":"tᵉshuʼâh","pron":"tesh-oo-aw'","def":"a crashing or loud clamor","kjv":"crying, noise, shouting, stir","deriv":"from H7722 (שׁוֹא)"},"H8664":{"lemma":"תִּשְׁבִּי","translit":"Tishbîy","pron":"tish-bee'","def":"a Tishbite or inhabitant of Tishbeh (in Gilead)","kjv":"Tishbite","deriv":"patrial from an unused name meaning recourse"},"H8665":{"lemma":"תַּשְׁבֵּץ","translit":"tashbêts","pron":"tash-bates'","def":"checkered stuff (as reticulated)","kjv":"broidered","deriv":"from H7660 (שָׁבַץ)"},"H8666":{"lemma":"תְּשׁוּבָה","translit":"tᵉshûwbâh","pron":"tesh-oo-baw'","def":"a recurrence (of time or place); a reply (as returned)","kjv":"answer, be expired, return","deriv":"or תְּשֻׁבָה; from H7725 (שׁוּב)"},"H8667":{"lemma":"תְּשׂוּמֶת","translit":"tᵉsûwmeth","pron":"tes-oo-meth'","def":"a deposit, i.e. pledging","kjv":"[phrase] fellowship","deriv":"from H7760 (שׂוּם)"},"H8668":{"lemma":"תְּשׁוּעָה","translit":"tᵉshûwʻâh","pron":"tesh-oo-aw'","def":"rescue (literal or figurative, persons, national or spiritual)","kjv":"deliverance, help, safety, salvation, victory","deriv":"or תְּשֻׁעָה; from H7768 (שָׁוַע) in the sense of H3467 (יָשַׁע)"},"H8669":{"lemma":"תְּשׁוּקָה","translit":"tᵉshûwqâh","pron":"tesh-oo-kaw'","def":"a longing","kjv":"desire","deriv":"from H7783 (שׁוּק) in the original sense of stretching out after"},"H8670":{"lemma":"תְּשׁוּרָה","translit":"tᵉshûwrâh","pron":"tesh-oo-raw'","def":"a gift","kjv":"present","deriv":"from H7788 (שׁוּר) in the sense of arrival"},"H8671":{"lemma":"תְּשִׁיעִי","translit":"tᵉshîyʻîy","pron":"tesh-ee-ee'","def":"ninth","kjv":"ninth","deriv":"ordinal from H8672 (תֵּשַׁע)"},"H8672":{"lemma":"תֵּשַׁע","translit":"têshaʻ","pron":"tay'-shah","def":"nine or (ordinal) ninth","kjv":"nine ([phrase] -teen, [phrase] -teenth, -th)","deriv":"or (masculine) תִּשְׁעָה; perhaps from H8159 (שָׁעָה) through the idea of a turn to the next or full number ten"},"H8673":{"lemma":"תִּשְׁעִים","translit":"tishʻîym","pron":"tish-eem'","def":"ninety","kjv":"ninety","deriv":"multiple from H8672 (תֵּשַׁע)"},"H8674":{"lemma":"תַּתְּנַי","translit":"Tattᵉnay","pron":"tat-ten-ah'-ee","def":"Tattenai, a Persian","kjv":"Tatnai","deriv":"of foreign derivation"}}